### Local secrets ###
# passwords for compose.yaml - never commit them, the template is .env.example
.env
# Postman secret values - never commit them, the template is postman/environments/local-example.environment.yaml
postman/environments/local.environment.yaml
# Postman globals of My Workspace (all my courses), copied here by the app - may hold secrets one day,
# and anyone can read this GitHub repository
postman/globals/

### Postman agent skills ###
# copies installed by the Postman CLI (`postman skills update`), they follow its version
.postman/skills.json
postman/skills/

### Local debug settings ###
# my own Spring Boot overrides (read after src/main/resources), never committed
/config/
